Package: com.parv.octopusbridge
Name: OctopusBridge
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Version: 0.5.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Routes native PTP requests from Windows into the Octopus app over a local socket.
 Injects into ptpd on iOS 17 (Dopamine). Verifies the binary UUID before installing any hooks.
 Defaults to HOOKS_ENABLED=0 (observation only) until Stage 3 runtime evidence is collected.
 Requires the Octopus app to be running with USB Access enabled.
 OctopusBridge is a companion tweak; Octopus itself is a TrollStore app, not a Sileo package.
Maintainer: Parv Tahiliani <pat113@pitt.edu>
Section: Tweaks
Tag: compatible_min::ios=17.0
